1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:05,350
Have you heard that a robot comes out when the green dome of the National Assembly opens?

2
00:00:05,350 --> 00:00:08,150
Here's the answer first: the dome doesn't open.

3
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:11,950
The dome is 64 m wide and weighs about 1,000 tons.

4
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:15,550
It wasn't in the first plan. They added it while building.

5
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:20,950
It was red copper at first, but it rusted over time and turned green.

6
00:00:20,950 --> 00:00:25,150
The 24 pillars around the building stand for the 24 seasons of the year.

7
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:29,750
The dome means many opinions come together into one through debate.

8
00:00:29,750 --> 00:00:33,650
It doesn't open, but inside, the country's decisions are made every day.
